From 078076449829374ad9fcec8064559f1908686d39 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: obviouslyvoid <obviouslyvoid@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 20:08:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Run the pre-vendor-unmount script for every explicit
 /vendor unmount

Add TWFunc::Prepare_Vendor_Unmount() and call it from the Mount screen, the unmount action, OpenRecoveryScript unmount, zip installs and the repacker, so devices whose vendor services run from /vendor can release it on request.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
